WEBVTT

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:03.710
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.670
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:08.730
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.570
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.050
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:58.050
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.430
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.430
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.410
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:24.750
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.920
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:30.860 --> 00:01:32.530
Mission complete.

00:01:38.740 --> 00:01:39.740
Amy!

00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:41.950
Sonic!

00:01:44.910 --> 00:01:49.940
Episode 29

00:01:44.910 --> 00:01:49.940
Amy the Captive

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:35.340
My priority is to collect the scattered shards and repair the Master Emerald.

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:38.590
All I can do for now is search for them.

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:50.020
X-Tornado taking off!

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:02.870
Tails is pushing himself too hard.

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:07.410
But I guess he'll be okay since Sonic is with him.

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:11.330
I hope they succeed in rescuing Amy.

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:15.130
I'm worried about Amy.

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:19.220
Amy will be fine because she's a strong girl.

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:23.550
Hey Tails, are you all right?

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:26.810
Yeah. I'm fine, Sonic.

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:29.680
You don't need to overdo it, Tails. I'll go alone.

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:32.690
I'm going too! I have to go.

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:34.610
You don't need to worry about me.

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:36.480
I'm not that hurt.

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:40.900
It's more important to hurry up and find the Egg Carrier and rescue Amy.

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:42.490
Here we go, Sonic.

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:44.780
Are you really okay, Tails?

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:46.620
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:49.700
Sonic, when did you go outside?

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:52.710
It's too cramped in there. I like it better out here.

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:54.880
I'm going to speed up, Sonic.

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:56.130
Okay.

00:03:59.510 --> 00:04:01.670
Hang on, Amy. We'll be right there!

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:12.100
This isn't the time to be fishing.

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:14.520
Aren't we supposed to be looking for Froggy?

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:21.900
Yes, but I feel that I'm going to hook something.

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:24.070
Sheesh...

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:28.370
X-Tornado!

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:30.950
I wonder if Tails is okay.

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:50.220
Let me out! Let me out of here!

00:04:50.510 --> 00:04:53.100
I said let me out of here!

00:04:56.350 --> 00:04:58.980
Why did this have to happen to me?

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:05.280
I wanted Sonic to enjoy my home-cooked meal.

00:05:06.110 --> 00:05:08.870
It's been six months since I started living on my own.

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:13.750
My cooking skills have improved quite a bit.

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:18.960
And our reunion was supposed to be more dramatic.

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:27.340
Amy?

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:29.760
I hardly recognized you!

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:35.680
I used to chase after you, but now you have to chase after me.

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:40.650
Amy, wait up!

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:46.400
I even had my speech prepared, but in reality, this is how I ended up.

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:51.030
I miss the days when I chased after Sonic.

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:56.540
Wait, Sonic!

00:06:08.970 --> 00:06:13.140
Back then, when I was in trouble, Sonic always came to rescue me.

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:17.480
Don't worry, Lily.

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:20.980
I'm sure Sonic will come to rescue us.

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:24.480
Sonic, please hurry and rescue me.

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:26.400
I'm right here.

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:39.830
Ahem, mic check.

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:41.630
Today is sunny.

00:06:43.090 --> 00:06:44.380
Be quiet!

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:49.880
Robots of the E-100 Series, listen carefully to my orders.

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:58.270
This frog with a tail is very important for our future plans.

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:06.230
Your mission is to search every nook and cranny for this frog and capture it.

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:12.070
We have no time to lose.

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:14.160
Now go!

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:57.370
Where am I?

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:00.830
That's...

00:08:12.220 --> 00:08:14.010
You're here, aren't you?

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:17.050
Please take everyone and flee.

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:25.100
I see. You say that you can't leave.

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:33.780
It'll be fine. There's nothing to worry about.

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:08.810
Those are the seven Emeralds.

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:25.250
You guided me here.

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:29.500
So you believe me.

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:35.970
What must be done... The seven chaos.

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:40.350
The one who masters it controls chaos.

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:45.390
The seven chaos... The one who controls it...

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:53.900
Is this the Emerald that controls the seven chaos?

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:09.630
This place...

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:12.920
This place looks familiar.

00:10:14.550 --> 00:10:16.090
I'm in front of the altar!

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:20.220
But what did I just see?

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:22.720
And who was that?

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:29.560
I've collected many pieces of the Master Emerald, so I'll put them back on the altar for now.

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:04.640
Even though I collected this many shards, it's still not enough.

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:06.520
Where are the remaining shards?

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:12.520
This is Eggman's flying fortress!

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:18.190
The Master Emerald shards must be inside.

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:43.340
Frog...

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:55.360
I got a frog.

00:11:56.520 --> 00:11:58.230
Me too.

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:00.990
I got one too.

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:09.040
I caught it!

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:14.670
I found Froggy.

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:16.460
That's incredible, Big!

00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:23.340
Frog capture complete.

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:27.300
Gamma also captured its target.

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:30.060
Now they all captured one.

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:32.310
Alright, retrieve them.

00:12:37.810 --> 00:12:38.190
Wait!

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:39.520
Wait up. Wait!

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:02.050
Big, we're going too.

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:02.880
Okay.

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:15.310
Mine is the real one.

00:13:15.310 --> 00:13:16.440
No, mine is.

00:13:17.100 --> 00:13:18.980
Mine has a better color.

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:21.070
Mine is prettier.

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:22.780
Be quiet!

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:26.030
Dr. Eggman will judge each one.

00:13:26.150 --> 00:13:27.860
Let's see.

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:35.210
Wrong!

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:36.790
That's not it either!

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:41.340
Neither is this!

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:44.460
No good!

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:49.430
You imbeciles! They're all completely the wrong frogs!

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:52.060
What are you keeping your eyes on?

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:53.850
Eyes? Right here.

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:02.190
Where did those robots go?

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:07.280
Where's Froggy?

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:10.030
Big, let's go over there.

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:14.830
You're all useless!

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:18.420
You're looking for a precious frog that has a Chaos's tail.

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:22.290
It swallowed a Chaos Emerald.

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:28.760
This is it! This is the real one!

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:34.350
Well done, Gamma! As expected, I knew you would be successful.

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:46.610
The rest of you are useless eyesores! Everyone except Gamma, leave immediately!

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:49.530
Okay.

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:09.510
Gamma seems worried.

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:12.090
Because the same thing may happen to it tomorrow.

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:17.020
Gamma, bring the bird that's locked in the prison.

00:15:23.770 --> 00:15:27.320
Lily, do you know what telepathy is?

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:33.280
When you care about someone, that person will always know how you feel.

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:36.370
Just like a flower petal carried along by the wind.

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:38.950
Sonic...

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:47.920
Sonic...

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:49.210
Amy?

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:53.550
I don't have the slightest idea where we are.

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:26.040
Beta...

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:37.640
Gamma, do you have the bird yet?

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:39.470
Hurry up and bring it!

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:55.860
Hand over the bird.

00:16:56.740 --> 00:17:00.370
No! I'm not giving you Lily! Never!

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:03.580
Calmly hand over the bird.

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:05.250
When I say no, I mean no!

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:06.540
Why not?

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:12.130
I don't need a reason! What do you intend to do with this bird?

00:17:12.300 --> 00:17:14.170
I have no information.

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:15.760
You don't know?

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:19.220
But I know you're not going to treat it kindly.

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:25.730
If you feel even the smallest bit of sympathy for this bird, please help us.

00:17:26.140 --> 00:17:28.400
Cannot comprehend.

00:17:28.860 --> 00:17:34.740
Why do you try so hard to help a complete stranger?

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:36.530
Cannot comprehend.

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:41.490
I see. Eggman doesn't teach you these things.

00:17:41.950 --> 00:17:42.910
Lily!

00:17:56.010 --> 00:17:58.260
My head hurts.

00:17:58.550 --> 00:17:59.890
What's wrong?

00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:01.930
Flee.

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:09.350
Hurry up and flee.

00:18:10.110 --> 00:18:11.440
Why?

00:18:11.440 --> 00:18:15.110
This place is dangerous. Hurry.

00:18:18.110 --> 00:18:20.490
Hurry up and flee.

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:27.290
You seem different from the other Eggman robots.

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:35.300
If you're not an evil robot, then the next time we meet, we'll meet as friends.

00:18:37.380 --> 00:18:38.590
Bye!

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:40.930
Friends...

00:18:53.770 --> 00:18:56.280
I found you, Egg Carrier!

00:18:56.440 --> 00:18:58.110
Hi, Knuckles.

00:18:59.280 --> 00:19:00.780
Want a lift?

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:11.040
Now that I have the frog, things are going great!

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:13.590
Dr. Eggman, it's the X-Tornado!

00:19:13.590 --> 00:19:14.500
What?

00:19:18.300 --> 00:19:19.920
They never give up.

00:19:19.920 --> 00:19:22.840
I guess they want to be shot down again.

00:19:41.030 --> 00:19:45.120
Decoe and Bocoe, fire at will!

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:46.870
Aye, sir!

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:49.700
Sonic and Knuckles, are you okay?

00:19:49.830 --> 00:19:50.910
We're fine.

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:54.170
But more importantly, it's attacking again!

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:05.220
I know!

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:14.400
I'm not scared. Since I lost earlier, I'll just pay him back in double!

00:20:16.820 --> 00:20:21.700
Sonic and Knuckles, I'm going to use the ace up my sleeve. Make sure you don't bite your tongues.

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:22.570
What?

00:20:22.570 --> 00:20:23.820
What do you mean?

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:28.080
X-Tornado, change to Battle Suit Version!

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:33.420
What?

00:20:42.510 --> 00:20:43.680
Since when could it do that?

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:48.220
Fine! Decoe and Bocoe, we're transforming too!

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:49.560
Aye aye, sir!

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:53.140
Egg Carrier formation change!

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:54.770
With just a push.

00:21:19.630 --> 00:21:23.300
Amazing! A ship that large transformed!

00:21:28.010 --> 00:21:30.050
Hang on!

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:44.530
Decoe and Bocoe, transform!

00:21:44.530 --> 00:21:49.870
Fine! I'm transforming into Crossfire Version!

00:21:50.120 --> 00:21:53.580
Hey Tails, did you forget what our mission is?

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:55.460
Oh yeah.

00:21:56.160 --> 00:22:00.000
Egg Carrier formation change!

00:22:13.310 --> 00:22:17.230
This is no good. This formation has no weapons.

00:22:17.230 --> 00:22:19.940
You idiot! Why did you change to a welcome reception?

00:22:19.940 --> 00:22:22.480
Hurry and switch to Battle Mode!

00:22:22.770 --> 00:22:23.900
Now's our chance!

00:22:27.110 --> 00:22:28.320
We're in!

00:22:28.320 --> 00:22:30.870
Okay, land on the Egg Carrier.

00:22:31.870 --> 00:22:33.950
Oh no!

00:22:34.290 --> 00:22:35.080
What's wrong?

00:22:35.120 --> 00:22:38.750
After transforming, this plane has no legs!

00:22:38.750 --> 00:22:40.330
What?

00:22:45.090 --> 00:22:54.510
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:45.090 --> 00:22:54.510
<i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i>

00:22:54.510 --> 00:23:03.480
<b>Ai suru to kime kisae namida ni ujirareteru</b>

00:22:54.510 --> 00:23:03.480
<i>The nervousness of love is sealed by tears.</i>

00:23:03.480 --> 00:23:12.370
<b>Boy boy futari de jumon wo sagashi ni ikou</b>

00:23:03.480 --> 00:23:12.370
<i>Boy, let’s search for a spell together,</i>

00:23:12.370 --> 00:23:21.960
<b>Kinji rareta yume wo kanaerareru kuni he</b>

00:23:12.370 --> 00:23:21.960
<i>To a land where our forbidden dreams can come true.</i>

00:23:22.830 --> 00:23:30.930
<b>Dare ni mo naisho de ashita na tchi awaseshiyou</b>

00:23:22.830 --> 00:23:30.930
<i>Let’s secretly meet tomorrow.</i>

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:41.100
<b>Itsuka kotori wo ume ta yowake no mieru oka de</b>

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:41.100
<i>At the place where we buried the bird, the hill where we can see the sunrise.</i>

00:23:41.690 --> 00:23:49.860
<b>Tsumetai asamoya kimi to te wo tsunaidara</b>

00:23:41.690 --> 00:23:49.860
<i>In the cold morning mist, if I hold hands with you.</i>

00:23:50.610 --> 00:23:59.040
<b>Hikaru michi no fuuin ga tokeru yo</b>

00:23:50.610 --> 00:23:59.040
<i>The seal to the shining path will be broken.</i>

00:23:59.560 --> 00:24:03.880
<b>Hateshinaku</b>

00:23:59.560 --> 00:24:03.880
<i>Forever...</i>

00:24:30.260 --> 00:25:35.430
Egg Carrier Battle
